This repository contains only the native minigame modules and their
build/packaging layer for the OM SYSTEM OM-3 (firmware 1.1). It does not
include any OM Digital Solutions / Olympus firmware, and it does not include the
upstream firmware-modification project.

Dependencies (referenced by name; not part of this repository):

- Caduceus for OM-3, v0.26.2 (Apache License 2.0, Copyright 2026 androidfanman),
  derived from Caduceus (cakelesscoder/caduceus-ep7, Apache-2.0). See
  https://github.com/androidfanman/caduceus-om3. Pinned at commit f4d2569.
  This project's game code builds on top of that pinned baseline; the Caduceus
  source itself is obtained separately and lives outside this repository.

- The official OM-3 firmware 1.1 file, supplied by the user. The combined
  (patched) image and the stock restore image are both produced from it during
  the build. Manufacturer firmware is never redistributed by this repository.

